# HTTP response security headers (mandatory)

Every HTTP response handler must set:

- `Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'`
- `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`
- `Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains`

Reject responses that omit any of the above when the route serves
HTML or JSON to a browser.

These headers apply to streaming endpoints too.
